            "end": 24,
            "text": "GR having taken opportunity."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 76
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Romans 7:11",
        "book": "Romans",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherefore the law is holy, and the commandment holy, and just, and good.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 18,
            "end": 20
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Romans 7:12",
        "book": "Romans",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Was then that which is good made death unto me? God forbid. But sin, that it might appear sin, working death in me by that which is good; that sin by the commandment might become exceeding sinful.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "GR May it not be!"
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Romans 7:13",
        "book": "Romans",
        "chapter": 7,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
